msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Excuse me, what are you doing here?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"You. Yes, ⟪k:28⟫you⟪k:29⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Com licença, o que você está fazendo aqui?⟪k:26⟫"
"⟪k:27⟫Você. Sim, ⟪k:28⟫você⟪k:29⟫."

#: omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 519b995703abda52c989ba1f1c4fda82c746e9e75c1d27177de7257c76c18e3f
#. default-sha256: cfa32647b79d15e8517ec5f111c6deef513f0be1152b98522b2b2dfceb5ca720
msgctxt "omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wish I knew how all these uninvited souls kept finding their way to my mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quem me dera saber como todas essas almas sem convite continuam encontrando "
"caminho até a minha mansão."

#: omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78167fe9893c2f86e966fa531918fbc612afca467833fb66804b9b73039f483d
#. default-sha256: 446e4c5a25bafac12a607b9cdb9fd01a11507efbadaecaade26380ae21c5e26a
msgctxt "omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you just completed the game and would like some time to dwell on it, you are welcome "
"to head back now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se você acabou de concluir o jogo e gostaria de um tempo para refletir, sinta-se à "
"vontade para voltar agora."

#: omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d15fda0ca817ba0cc5a0a2ad4024ddaa0fa5e9c922a8d65470e9de1868f8247
#. default-sha256: 4f3668f2d10fa750b29b83b7675233c9349183b06df8663ae3565fb9ab8a852c
msgctxt "omake:omake_9790113F_2F86_4B78_AC2E_10D8DB9E56B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ll see people who shouldn’t be here. Things that contradict the events of the game. "
"A general sense of pandemonium. You’d do best not to think much of any of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você verá pessoas que não deveriam estar aqui. Coisas que contradizem os eventos do "
"jogo. Um senso geral de pandemônio. O melhor é não pensar muito sobre nada disso."

#: omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b2bdac3b9a189142f72c46ab657370f58c135ab02c2fd24caa4b59929a3fc0c
#. default-sha256: aa07789e8cf63ed62eb507714faefffc996818f269a6bc32f9e4aa7c43aaa3f4
msgctxt "omake:omake_8B5E920F_01AA_4FFF_9770_40716C0F563B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m not particularly attached to having long hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não sou muito apegado a ter cabelo comprido."

#: omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b583ca0171a030ec1e8a9a47de081dc8a403047e290fe4a6571856ad442def4
#. default-sha256: ec7f1116b61be19020a286b4c859f9ff6a4e511742908db28bfddeb9a364f21e
msgctxt "omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mmm, I’m not sure how I feel about that idea.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I quite enjoy playing with your hair, "
"myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hmm, não sei se gosto dessa ideia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu gosto muito de brincar com o seu cabelo."

#: omake:omake_3FF00017_67C5_48C1_A183_28621D7983CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 876a78e152a1ee974d0198017384ee408eb74fbde0791e374f15d5e4cc3373e7
