"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫H-⟪k:7⟫Hey! What was that for?!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And be careful what "
"you wish for, quite literally!⟪k:10⟫We might actually go up in flames!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫H-⟪k:7⟫hei! Por que isso?!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E cuidado com o que "
"deseja, literalmente!⟪k:10⟫A gente pode acabar pegando fogo de verdade!"

