msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, so you can’t see the soul beside me?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That’s quite a shame."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, então você não consegue ver a alma ao meu lado?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Que pena."

#: omake:omake_13AF1031_2797_48CE_9EED_67E0B79A030B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cdb0058d25167c3d9c0a20427d0c6b5f9e5cf174409fc174c8bdb1a1c5bd866
